<title>THAILAND: Jasmine to pay 1.50 baht second half div.</title>
<headline>Jasmine to pay 1.50 baht second half div.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  1.50    vs     N/A</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 April 1, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	May 14, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE: Jasmine International Plc is a telecommunications firm. The company paid dividend of three baht for the 1995 period.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662-652-0642)</p>
</text>
